    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia**_\n\n## Summary\nDesign doc `docs/architecture/relationship-annotator-citation-layer.org`: a switchable layer in `relationship-annotator` that shows possible citations (built from `[cite:@key]` mentions in Org notes, read by a Vulpea extractor), refined one by one into typed relations (`supports`, `opposes`, `defends`, ...), with DEVONthink similarity as a later second layer.\n\nDesign only; no code. Follows #209 (DEVONthink design) and #210 (`ROAM_REFS`). The doc ends with four questions to decide before building.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Read the doc and answer the open questions (roll-up, `is-part-of`, keys without a litnote, where the refined line is written).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
